    "text": "The hybridization and magnetic behaviour of cobalt ion in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Co</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msub><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;complex, respectively is",
